perception 1
# The agents' senses: the nearest intruder that they see or hear, whether they see it, and where they last perceived
# it; and the nearest noise that they remember, and where it was. An intruder's steps are noises of its own, which keep
# its place in the memory without sight (see docs/ai/perception.md#hearing).
notices Player, Noise
target = nearest Player
can_see_target = visible target
last_seen = position target
noise = nearest Noise
noise_at = position noise
